      "message": "For the HCI timeouts, we have seen it in various commands like `LE_ADV_FILTER`, `LE_GET_VENDOR_CAPABILITIES` and recently `WRITE_SCAN_ENABLE`. They mainly happened in the old controller but we don\u0027t actually know what triggers the issue.",
      "parentUuid": "8357a73c_cc69cac2",
